{"name":"Nostalgic Evening","hex":"#47626f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"nostalgic","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of, having, or relating to nostalgia."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who displays nostalgia for something."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/nostalgic"},{"term":"evening","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The time of day between afternoon and night.","The time of the day between the approximate time of midwinter dusk and midnight (compare afternoon); the period after the end of regular office working hours."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of even"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/evening"}],"entries":[{"title":"Nostalgia","blocks":[{"text":"Nostalgia is an emotion which is often described as a bittersweet longing for the past, typically for a period of time accompanied by happy memories or emotions. It is often described as a sort of sad pleasure, which typically involves longing for a past memory, whether real or romanticized, that cannot be recovered. It can also refer to a type of homesickness."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/SaturdayEveningPost30Aug1924.jpg/330px-SaturdayEveningPost30Aug1924.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nostalgia","wikidata":"Q12151852"},{"title":"Evening","blocks":[{"text":"Evening is the period of a day that begins at the end of afternoon and overlaps with the beginning of night. It starts when the sun is close to the horizon and, according to most definitions, spans the period of night before bedtime or midnight. The exact times when evening begins and ends are subjective and depend on location and time of year. In some cases, evening is considered to begin during daylight; before sunset."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Evening_in_Parambikkulam%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg/330px-Evening_in_Parambikkulam%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evening","wikidata":"Q7725"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg/500px-Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg/1280px-Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg/500px-Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Tweed run, 2013","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATweed_run_20130413_180.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg/500px-Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg/1280px-Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg/500px-Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Rider in vintage clothing astride a vintage BSA motorcycle on High Street in Honiton, England, in July 2023","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/La_Laitemaire.jpg/500px-La_Laitemaire.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/La_Laitemaire.jpg/1280px-La_Laitemaire.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.